---
// Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative pt-6 pb-12 sm:pb-16 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Ambient light glows behind hero -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[650px] h-[350px] bg-purple-600/20 blur-[130px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/4 w-[380px] h-[280px] bg-pink-600/15 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-purple-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#15112f] via-[#100d24] to-[#0a0818] shadow-2xl shadow-purple-950/40">
      
      <!-- Subtle neon wave lines overlay -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(#d946ef_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px]"></div>

      <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 min-h-[460px] lg:min-h-[520px] items-center">
        
        <!-- Left Side: Copy and Actions -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center z-10">
          
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-900/40 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 text-xs font-semibold mb-6 w-fit shadow-sm">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-400 animate-ping"></span>
            <span>Descubre la Nueva Colección</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6">
            Explora Nuevas <br />
            <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 via-purple-300 to-indigo-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
              Sensaciones
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-purple-200/80 max-w-md font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
            El placer de descubrir y sentir sin prejuicios. Juguetes íntimos de alta gama, feromonas y bienestar con despacho 100% confidencial.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a 
              href="#mas-vendidos"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-purple-600 to-pink-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-pink-500 shadow-xl shadow-purple-600/30 hover:shadow-purple-500/50 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200"
            >
              Ver catálogo
            </a>
            <a 
              href="#categorias"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white rounded-full bg-purple-950/40 hover:bg-purple-900/60 border border-purple-500/20 transition-all duration-200"
            >
              Explorar Categorías
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider Dots indicator (as shown in mockup) -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-12">
            <span class="w-6 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-500"></span>
            <span class="w-2 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-800"></span>
            <span class="w-2 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-800"></span>
            <span class="w-2 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-800"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: Cinematic Image Card matching mockup -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative h-72 sm:h-96 lg:h-full min-h-[380px] lg:min-h-[520px] overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t lg:bg-gradient-to-r from-[#100d24] via-transparent to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <img 
            src="/images/hero-banner.jpg" 
            alt="Explora Nuevas Sensaciones - Pareja íntima" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center scale-100 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            loading="eager"
          />

          <!-- Floating badge -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 z-20 glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-purple-400/30 shadow-xl hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/20 border border-pink-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 text-lg">
              ✨
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Despacho 100% Neutro</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-purple-300/80">Sin nombres de tienda en el empaque</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
